{"words": [{"text": "فَأَمَّا", "translation": "Then as for"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "disbelieve[d]"}, {"text": "فَأُعَذِّبُهُمْ", "translation": "then I will punish them"}, {"text": "عَذَابًۭا", "translation": "(with) a punishment"}, {"text": "شَدِيدًۭا", "translation": "severe"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "the world"}, {"text": "وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "translation": "and (in) the Hereafter"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "لَهُم", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "any"}, {"text": "نَّـٰصِرِينَ", "translation": "helpers"}], "sahih": "And as for those who disbelieved, I will punish them with a severe punishment in this world and the Hereafter, and they will have no helpers.\""}